kind":"update","title":"Another quick patch for the demo version","summary":"This quick patch includes the following changes in response to requests from the community (and a huge thank you for such wonderful feedback!):Added the option to limit the game’s frame rate (currently via buttons; I’ll change this to a proper slider later)Improved pathfinding and collision detection on mapsWeapons have been rebalanced. Large weapons no longer lose out to ten small ones.Units can now be organised into groups using Ctrl+1, Ctrl+2 and so on, and then selected using the correspondi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T18:28:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706696368","verified_at":"2026-10-21T08:10:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4824250-1846018067925981","game_id":"steam-4824250","kind":"announcement","title":"Merc Commander Demo is now available!","summary":"A huge thank you to everyone who took part in the playtest. Thanks to your feedback, I was able to fix a huge number of small issues and polish many of the game's quality-of-life features.The work is, of course, far from finished. I'll continue making changes and improvements based on your feedback.But today, I'm happy to finally present the Merc Commander demo.The demo includes 10 missions and at least two hours of gameplay and can be found here: Play the Merc Commander Demo on Steam Unfortunat","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T12:46:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067925981","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:27:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4824250-1842846814451492","game_id":"steam-4824250","kind":"announcement","title":"Merc Commander Playtest is live","summary":"Good day, everyone.Today, I’d like to invite you to a Merc Commander playtest.For you, this could be an opportunity to get a feel for what the game is about and whether it meets your expectations. For me, it’s a chance to get some feedback.To start off, we’ll begin with 100 players (I don’t want to embarrass myself in front of a large crowd right away).Please feel free to share any thoughts you may have. Bugs, issues, ideas - please let me know about everything.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-06T18:57:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814451492","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:27:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4824250":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:27:10Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T04:27:09Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4824250":"2026-10-26T04:27:10Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4824250":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:27:09Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:27:09Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5192660":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:27:10Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:27:10Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4824250","app_id":4824250,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:59Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"e3ec360da7e103e4bb7e621d2e5a97335d9f6b91736f016127dcc57364a2c26f","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Merc Commander는 용병 메크 조종사들로 구성된 회사를 이끄는 실시간 전술 RPG입니다. 전투에서 부대를 지휘하고, 메크를 커스터마이즈하고 업그레이드하며, 적의 기계를 노획하고, 성장하는 용병 회사를 운영하세요. 고전적인 메크 전술 게임의 황금기에서 영감을 받았습니다.","publishers":[{"name":"iDeever"}],"developers":[{"name":"iDeever"